# p5 mcp discover: a 2026-07-28 HTTP server whose discover answer comes on an event stream
# under HTTP 500 (mcphttp.ts `ssefail`). fx reads an event stream's answers whatever the
# status (`readEvents`, src/mcp/io/http.zig:643-692@481104fd), where a JSON body's result
# under an error status is no answer (`run`, :469-485): ready at 2026-07-28.
# `gwlog` copies the server log.
mcphttp ssefail
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-http-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-http-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-hello.json
wait 6
type /mcp show fixture
key Enter
wait 3
snap show
gwlog
